sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Merchant Client
    participant Gateway as API Gateway (Envoy)
    participant Saga as Saga Orchestrator (Temporal)
    participant Ledger as Double-Entry Ledger Core
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Core DB
    participant Outbox as outbox_events Table
    participant WAL as PostgreSQL Write-Ahead Log
    participant CDC as Debezium CDC Connector
    participant Kafka as Apache Kafka Event Bus
    participant Rail as External Banking Rail Adapter

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/payouts (Idempotency-Key: "idemp_abc123")
    Gateway->>Saga: Initialize Payout Saga Workflow

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Saga,Outbox: Step 1: Atomic Ledger Hold & Outbox Insert
        Saga->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        Saga->>Ledger: Reserve Funds (Hold Leg on Source Account)
        Ledger->>DB: INSERT INTO entry_legs (direction='DEBIT', status='HOLD')
        Saga->>Outbox: INSERT INTO outbox_events (type='payout.dispatched', payload)
        Saga->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        DB-->>Saga: Commit Success (ACID Local Guarantee)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 250)
        Note over DB,Kafka: Step 2: Zero Dual-Write Event Streaming via CDC
        DB->>WAL: Append Commit Record to WAL
        WAL->>CDC: Debezium reads logical WAL streaming replication
        CDC->>Kafka: Publish CloudEvent v1.0 (Topic: payments.outbox)
        Kafka-->>CDC: Cluster ACK (min.isr=2, acks=all)
        CDC->>DB: Commit Replication Slot Offset
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        Note over Kafka,Rail: Step 3: Banking Rail Execution & Settlement
        Kafka->>Rail: Consume Payout Dispatched Event
        Rail->>Rail: Dispatch to Central Bank (ISO 20022 pacs.008)
        alt Banking Rail Confirms Settlement (Success)
            Rail->>Saga: Payout Confirmed (pacs.002 ACCP)
            Saga->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
            Saga->>Ledger: Commit Hold (Settle to Clearing Nostro)
            Saga->>Outbox: INSERT INTO outbox_events (type='payout.completed')
            Saga->>DB: COMMIT
            Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (Status: SETTLED)
        else Banking Rail Rejects or Times Out (Terminal Failure)
            Rail->>Saga: Payout Rejected (pacs.002 RJCT)
            Saga->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION (Compensating Transaction)
            Saga->>Ledger: Release Hold (Restore Merchant Balance)
            Saga->>Outbox: INSERT INTO outbox_events (type='payout.reversed')
            Saga->>DB: COMMIT
            Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 400 Bad Request (Status: FAILED_REVERSED)
        end
    end
